---
// Module 4: Triads and Roman Numerals. Behold builds each diatonic
// triad note-by-note on the clock; Derive locks the picker so the
// listener can compare shapes; Operate plays the triad and two stock
// progressions so the cadential pull (V → I) becomes audible.
import Module4Behold from './Module4Behold';
import Module4Derive from './Module4Derive';
import Module4Operate from './Module4Operate';
import Module4Prompts from './Module4Prompts';
---

<div class="m4">
  <section class="m4-block">
    <p class="m4-eyebrow">behold</p>
    <p>
      Start at any scale degree. Skip one diatonic note, then another
      — you've stacked two thirds and built a triad. Do this from each
      of the seven degrees and you get the diatonic chord family:
      I, ii, iii, IV, V, vi, vii°.
    </p>
    <Module4Behold client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m4-block">
    <p class="m4-eyebrow">derive</p>
    <p>
      Three intervals: a third (3 or 4 semitones) and a fifth (6, 7, or
      8). Combine them and the triad lands in one of four qualities —
      <strong>major</strong>, <strong>minor</strong>,{' '}
      <strong>diminished</strong>, <strong>augmented</strong>. The
      diatonic scale generates three majors, three minors, and one
      diminished, in the fixed order M-m-m-M-M-m-dim. That pattern is
      the fingerprint of every major key.
    </p>
    <Module4Derive client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m4-block">
    <p class="m4-eyebrow">operate</p>
    <p>
      Hear them. Each triad in isolation, then the two stock
      progressions that show up in nearly every pop song ever
      recorded — <code>I–IV–V–I</code> and <code>I–vi–IV–V</code>.
      The root motion is a walk through generators of Z<sub>12</sub>:
      this is Module 2 still doing work, one floor up.
    </p>
    <Module4Operate client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m4-block">
    <p class="m4-eyebrow">prompt</p>
    <p class="m4-prompt-intro">
      Two cards on triad quality.
    </p>
    <Module4Prompts client:visible />
  </section>

  <section class="m4-block m4-bridge">
    <p class="m4-eyebrow">bridge</p>
    <p>
      The chords have names. They also have <em>tendencies</em>: V wants
      to land on I, ii wants to lead into V, vi can stand in for I. That
      structure of pull and resolution is harmonic function — the
      next module.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

<style is:global>
  /* Module 4 chrome. */
  .m4 {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  .m4-block {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m4-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }
  .m4 p {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .m4 p em {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .m4 p strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m4 code {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    color: var(--accent-dim);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.05em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .m4-bridge p {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent-dim);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m4-prompt-intro {
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
  }

  /* Behold ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m4-behold {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .m4-behold-scale {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m4-scale-dot {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .m4-scale-dot.in-chord {
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232, 168, 56, 0.1);
  }
  .m4-behold-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .m4-behold-roman {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .m4-behold-quality {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .m4-behold-spell {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .m4-behold-caption {
    font-size: 0.9rem !important;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  /* Degree picker — shared between Derive + Operate -------------------- */
  .m4-degree-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .m4-degree-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m4-degree-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m4-degree-btn {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.1rem;
    min-width: 3rem;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m4-degree-btn:hover:not(:disabled):not(.active) {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m4-degree-btn.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .m4-degree-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .m4-degree-roman {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .m4-degree-quality {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  }
  .m4-degree-btn.active .m4-degree-quality {
    color: var(--bg);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* Chord-on-staff wrapper for Derive ----------------------------------- */
  .m4-staff-wrap {
    background: #f5efe0;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem 0.2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    color: #1f1408;
    line-height: 0;
  }
  .m4-staff-wrap .chord-staff svg {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Derive ---------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m4-derive {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m4-derive-info {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m4-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .m4-stat-label {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.58rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .m4-stat-value {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .m4-stat-quality {
    font-family: var(--font-crimson);
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .m4-derive-caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    max-width: 40ch;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }

  /* Operate --------------------------------------------------------------- */
  .m4-operate {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .m4-operate-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .m4-operate-play {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 1.1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      background 0.15s ease,
      color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m4-operate-play:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--accent-dim);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m4-operate-play:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    background: var(--bg-button);
    color: var(--text-dim);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }
  .m4-operate-prog {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition:
      color 0.15s ease,
      border-color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .m4-operate-prog:hover:not(:disabled) {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
  }
  .m4-operate-prog:disabled {
    cursor: default;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .m4-operate-caption {
    font-size: 0.92rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim) !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 44ch;
    line-height: 1.5 !important;
  }

  .m4-prompts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
